'''Inyusu Tor''' was a large volcanic mountain on [[Sullust]]. At the top of it was the [[Inyusu Tor mineral processing facility]]. As well as this, Sullust's [[capital]] [[Pinyumb]] was located under the south side of the mountain. During the [[Galactic Civil War]], the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] [[Siege of Inyusu Tor|took over]] the facility and successfully defended it from the local [[97th Legion|Imperial garrison]].<ref name="TC" />

